===========================================================================
Third-party components
===========================================================================

Neuro-Enhance uses the following components. They are not part of this
repository; pip installs them from the Python Package Index. A released
executable bundles them together with their licence texts.

PySide6 / Qt for Python
  Copyright The Qt Company Ltd. and other contributors
  Licence: GNU Lesser General Public License v3.0 (LGPL-3.0)
  https://www.qt.io/qt-for-python
  Neuro-Enhance uses PySide6 and Qt unmodified and links them dynamically.
  You may replace the Qt and PySide6 libraries with your own build. The
  source code of Qt is available from https://download.qt.io/ and
  https://code.qt.io/.

nvidia-ml-py (NVIDIA Management Library bindings)
  Copyright NVIDIA Corporation
  Licence: BSD 3-Clause
  https://pypi.org/project/nvidia-ml-py/

Planned for later versions (listed here once they are used):
  CuPy (MIT), NumPy (BSD 3-Clause), ONNX Runtime (MIT),
  NVIDIA CUDA runtime and NVIDIA TensorRT (NVIDIA licence agreements;
  installed from NVIDIA's own packages, not redistributed by this project).

===========================================================================
AI models
===========================================================================

AI models are not part of this repository. Each model is subject to its own
licence, which Neuro-Enhance shows together with its source before
downloading. Only models whose licence permits use and redistribution in an
open-source project are offered by default.

